t\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><a href=\"https://www.google.pl/search?site=&amp;q=Mars&amp;ct=evidence-of-water-found-on-mars-5652760466817024&amp;hl=en&amp;sa=X&amp;ved=0CAMQNmoVChMIrZi99-abyAIVh8ByCh1MKgJ9&amp;biw=1366&amp;bih=643&amp;dpr=1&amp;oi=ddle\" target=\"_blank\">NASA has officially confirmed that flowering water was on Mars</a> - so there <i>where </i>water filled canals. So there could be Venetia-like cities and trade routes on the face of this desert planet. And few millions ago Red Planet could have been green and blue with waters and forests, like Earth.<br /> <br /> <i>So what does this all could mean for the setting of <b>Cavaliers</b>?</i></div> </div> </div> </div>I would say it is still too soon to actually speak of a green and blue Mars in RL, but it is a piece of news that does offer some inspiration/reinforcement to the imagery Cavaliers' setting is based upon.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-29T13:39:48-07:00","id":682324,"title":"","content":"It's cool news, isn't it?<br /> <br /> Although our map of Mars isn't entirely realistic, the ocean that's been theorized for the last few years is a part of the <i>Cavaliers</i> backstory. There's a beached formerly-undersea First Martian city to explore...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Cavaliers of Mars Creator</b><br /> <b>Retired CofD Lead</b><br /> <br /> Check out my <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Rose%20Bailey\" target=\"_blank\">guides to </a><a href=\"https://www.storyteller